            "brief": "Deliverable: a reusable unit-conversion toolkit. Required behavior: demonstrate function, parameter, argument, return value, scope; complete one normal, one boundary, and one invalid case; and keep a short expected-versus-actual test record. Evidence: the exact run command, the repaired defect, the three final results, and an honest README.",
